{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>The tent of Korah.</b> It seems right to me that Korah had a tent for his own people and property, far from the camp of the Levites, and near his tent were the tents of Dathan and Abiram, for none camp around the Tabernacle but the Levites alone. And from this verse we learn that the banner-chieftain camped near the camp of the Levites."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:01.237976274Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}